# Whole-sheet recolour for everything that is not a person (decision D27, owner 2026-11-05: similar to RPG Maker but our brand).
# GEN rows set the tone; SHEET | <path under the RPG Maker image root> | <outline 0 or 1> [| <lightness levels, overrides GEN levels>]. A pure per-pixel function: the same source colour gives the same output colour anywhere, so no seams.
# NOT here on purpose: the A2 sheets (built from blocks.pdl with ramps by the sheet-png verb), and every person: characters, faces, sv_actors, sv_enemies, big monsters, vehicles (the cast track).
GEN | hue | -10
GEN | sat | 112
GEN | levels | 6
GEN | outline | 1
